==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|hvað segirðu}} {{q|more common}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˌkʰvaː(ð) ˈseiːjɪru/}} 
* {{IPA|is|/ˌkʰvaː(ð) ˈseiːjɪr θuː/}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|hvað||what}} + {{m|is|segir||you say}} the second person form of the verb {{m|is|segja||to say}} + {{m|is|þú||you}}. Literally meaning "what say you?".

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase|head=[[hvað]] [[segja#Icelandic|segir]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]?}}

# [[how are you]]?
#: {{uxi|is|'''Hvað segir þú'''? - [[Allt gott]], [[takk fyrir]].|'''How are you?''' - I'm fine, thanks.}}
#: {{uxi|is|'''Hvað segir þú''' gott?|'''How are you'''?}}

